# Worker-only configuration belongs on the separate worker host:
# MAILER_DATABASE_URL, same DATABASE_CA_CERT and SUPABASE_URL,
# APP_ENV, APP_ORIGIN, SMTP provider settings. No worker schedule is enabled here.
# Use 07-runtime-credentials.ps1 -CopyConnection app_web / -CopyCa / -NewSecret
